The source model card labels OpenVLA checkpoints MIT and identifies Llama-2,
DINOv2 and SigLIP as their underlying components. The bundled released tokenizer
assets have Llama-2 lineage: LICENSE-LLAMA2 and LLAMA2-USE-POLICY.md reproduce
Meta's terms and acceptable-use policy. This port does not relicense underlying
models, tokenizer data or training datasets. No trained model weights are bundled.

Llama 2 is licensed under the LLAMA 2 Community License,
